b wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Uncertainty island is located on far west side of <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a> behind the mountains. It can be accessed by swimming around the whole island, walking over the mountain or by using grabby grabber flight glitch.\n</p><p>The island has multiple lightslate nodes with ink as well as palm trees which are located on the beach.\n</p><p>In the middle there is a sign which says \"<b>UNCERTAINTY ISLAND</b>\".\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Uncertainty island is not actually an island as it's connected to the Ferwater island.</li>\n<li>It <i>can</i> be used as a way to farm inkstone, but it will be very inefficient because there is no way for vehicles to get here.</li>\n<li>Appears to be mainly an easter egg for curious players, but it may have a proper function in a future update.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ff3a959bf7fe10e8e57dcbfd9eb6d156\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:71px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Uncertaintyislandsign-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:69px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Uncertaintyislandsign.png\" title=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png (3.09 MB)\" style=\"height:69px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Uncertaintyislandsign.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230801144400\" title=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png (3.09 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sign\" height=\"69\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png\" data-image-key=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sign\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png (3.09 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sign\" height=\"69\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png\" data-image-key=\"Uncertaintyislandsign.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sign\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Uncertaintyislandsign.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230801144400\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sign</div></div></div>\n<table class=\"navbox